# comms/divisions.list — the AUTHORITATIVE division roster for the comms bus.
#
# Deliberate eight-division allowlist. A division is recognised by the bus ONLY if it is
# listed here (dispatch targets, spoke self-identity, `collect`). Adding a division is a
# CONSCIOUS edit — it is never auto-absorbed just because a new divisions/<name>/ dir appears.
# Auto-discovery is demoted to a hygiene SENTINEL (`bus.sh sentinel`) that FLAGS any
# divisions/*/ dir absent from this list (a stray dir, or an R&D instrument such as the
# former divisions/research-mathsavant/). The sentinel never grants membership.
#
# Format: one division name per line; `#` comments and blank lines are ignored.
development
security-redteam
qa-release-eng
docs-devrel
design-product
infrastructure-platform
research-rnd
ip-legal-strategy
